: null, "installs": 52, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "last_synced_at": null, "name": "Excalidraw Diagrams for Obsidian", "ownerName": "ricardodpalmeida", "score": 82370.820668693, "slug": "excalidraw-diagrams", "source": "clawhub", "stars": 3, "subCategories": [{"key": "design-image-gen", "name": "图片生成"}, {"key": "design-visual-asset", "name": "视觉素材"}], "tags": null, "updated_at": 1781673027338, "upstream_owner_login": "ricardodpalmeida", "upstream_url": "https://clawhub.ai/ricardodpalmeida/excalidraw-diagrams", "verified": false, "version": "1.0.2"}, {"category": "business-ops", "claim_state": "unclaimed", "claimable": true, "claimed_user_handle": null, "created_at": 1772774654961, "description": "10-dimension weighted scoring framework for prediction market trade evaluation.\nEnforces disciplined position sizing, circuit breakers, and mandatory counter-arguments.\n\nUse when: evaluating prediction market trades, scoring opportunities, deciding position sizes,\ncomparing Polymarket/Kalshi opportunities, running pre-trade checklists.\n\nDon't use when: general crypto analysis, DeFi yield farming, non-prediction-market investments,\nstock/equity analysis, sports betting (different framework needed).\n\nNegative examples:\n- \"Should I buy ETH?\" → No. This is for prediction markets with binary/discrete outcomes.\n- \"What's the best DeFi yield?\" → No. Wrong domain entirely.\n- \"Score this sports bet\" → No. Sports betting has different dimensions (injuries, matchups).\n\nEdge cases:\n- Crypto prediction markets (e.g., \"Will BTC hit $X?\") → YES, use this if on Polymarket/Kalshi.\n- Multi-outcome markets → Score each outcome separately.\n- Markets with <$25 liquidity → Auto-fail on Liquidity dimension.", "description_zh": "用于评估预测市场交易的十维加权评分框架。强制执行严格的仓位控制、熔断机制及强制性反向论证。\n\n适用场景：评估预测市场交易、机会评分、确定仓位大小、对比Polymarket/Kalshi机会、执行交易前检查清单。\n\n不适用场景：常规加密货币分析、DeFi挖矿、非预测市场投资、股票/权益分析、体育博彩（需使用其他框架）。\n\n负面示例：\n- “我该买ETH吗？” → 不适用。本框架仅针对二元或离散结果的预测市场。\n- “最高DeFi收益是多少？” → 不适用。领域完全不符。\n- “给这个体育博彩打分” → 不适用。体育博彩涉及不同维度（如伤病、对阵）。\n\n边缘情况：\n- 加密货币预测市场（如“BTC是否会达X美元？”） → 适用，只要在Polymarket/Kalshi上即可。\n- 多结果市场 → 需分别对每个结果评分。\n- 流动性低于25美元的市场 → 在流动性维度自动判定为不合格。", "downloads": 1023, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/staybased/trade-validation", "iconUrl": null, "installs": 40, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "last_synced_at": null, "name": "Trade Validation", "ownerName": "staybased", "score": 84411.53546375681, "slug": "trade-validation", "source": "clawhub", "stars": 3, "subCategories": [{"key": "biz-sales", "name": "销售助手"}, {"key": "biz-growth", "name": "增长分析"}, {"key": "biz-project-management", "name": "项目管理"}], "tags": null, "updated_at": 1781673037014, "upstream_owner_login": "staybased", "upstream_url": "https://clawhub.ai/staybased/trade-validation", "verified": false, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "professional", "claim_state": "unclaimed", "claimable": true, "claimed_user_handle": null, "created_at": 1772786627105, "description": "Provides expert guidance on applying the Elliott Wave Principle to financial market analysis. Use when the user asks about wave counting, identifying impulse...", "description_zh": "提供艾略特波浪理论在金融市场分析中的专业指导，适用于用户询问波浪计数、识别推动浪等技术分析问题。", "downloads": 1019, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/raeed44-creator/elliott-wave-principle", "iconUrl": null, "installs": 90, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "last_synced_at": null, "name": "elliott-wave-principle", "ownerName": "raeed44-creator", "score": 83968.87159533074, "slug": "elliott-wave-principle", "source": "clawhub", "stars": 3, "subCategories": [{"key": "pro-finance", "name": "金融分析"}], "tags": null, "updated_at": 1781673034945, "upstream_owner_login": "raeed44-creator", "upstream_url": "https://clawhub.ai/raeed44-creator/elliott-wave-principle", "verified": false, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "data-analysis", "claim_state": "unclaimed", "claimable": true, "claimed_user_handle": null, "created_at": 1772779241687, "description": "监控 GitHub、Re